15 Bile Processing Protocol: Collect bile in sterile bottles from patients with biliary tubes. Centrifuge at $3000g$ for 10 minutes at $4^{\circ}C$ to remove sediment and debris. Aliquot the clear bile into 1 ml volumes in microcentrifuge tubes. Store the aliquots at $-20^{\circ}C$ for future use.   
